s Maria. Let's get the live call booked for tomorrow.\nAgent: Got it, Maria — and what’s your last name?\nUser: My last name is Gonzales. Let's proceed to book the live call for tomorrow.\nAgent: Got it, Maria Gonzales — and is the number you’re calling from the best contact number to reach you for the SMS confirmation?\nUser: Yes, my best contact number is +13125551234. Please use that for the SMS confirmation.\nAgent: Perfect — and which time zone are you in: Eastern, Central, Mountain, or Pacific?\nUser: I'm in the Central Time Zone, America/Chicago.\nAgent: Got it — tomorrow I can get you in as soon as **10:00 AM** or **10:45 AM** Central time. Which works?\nUser: Neither works. Do you have any afternoon slots available for the live call tomorrow?\nAgent: Yes — tomorrow afternoon I can do **1:00 PM** or **1:45 PM** Central time. Which one do you want?\nUser: 1:00 PM Central time works for me. Please book the live call for then.\nAgent: So that’s **tomorrow (Thu, Aug 27)** at **1:00 PM Central**, correct?\nUser: Yes, that's perfect — please book it for tomorrow at 1:00 PM Central.\nAgent: Perfect — I’ve got you down for tomorrow at 1:00 PM Central for the live call with Jay. We’ll talk through how we catch those after-hours calls for Bright Smile Dental and turn them into booked patients. Thanks, Maria — talk tomorrow.",
